  "id": "slow-cooker-beef-and-barley-soup",
  "name": "Slow Cooker Beef and Barley Soup",
  "subtitle": "A hearty slow-cooked soup with tender beef, barley, and vegetables.",
  "description": "Beef soup bones, vegetables, herbs, garlic, and barley cook together into a savory, filling soup.",
